# `lib/` data and logic

Use when editing `aiengineerapp/lib/`. Imports use `@/lib/...` (see **project-architecture**).

## Supabase (`lib/supabase/`)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `server.ts` | `createServerSupabase()` — RSC, Server Actions, route handlers; reads/writes session cookies. Typed with `Database`. |
| `browser.ts` | Client-side `createBrowserClient` for interactive components. |
| `admin.ts` | Service-role client — **server-only**, bypasses RLS; migrations/admin tasks only. |
| `env.ts` | URL + anon key resolution (supports publishable-key env names). |
| `middleware.ts` | `refreshSession`, `copyCookies` — used by **`proxy.ts`**. |

## Data access (`lib/db/`)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `entities.ts` | Entity rows / lookups by kind. |
| `dossier.ts` | Full dossier payload for entity detail pages. |
| `entity-summary.ts` | Map DB rows → `EntitySummary` for cards and lists. |
| `profile.ts` | Shell profile (display name, avatar, email) for layout. |
| `stats.ts` | XP / streak and related stats for shell. |

## Search & explore (`lib/search/`)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `searchAll.ts` | `search_all` RPC wrapper and result typing. |
| `searchFuzzy.ts` | Trigram / fuzzy search path. |
| `explore.ts` | Explore listing + RPCs for `/explore/[type]`. |
| `explore-shared.ts` | Shared parsing, cursors, filters between explore surfaces. |
| `matchChunks.ts` | Vector / chunk matching helpers (ties to `retrieval`). |
| `types.ts` | Search/explore TypeScript types. |

## Schema (`lib/schema/`)

- **`entity-kind.ts`** — `ENTITY_KINDS`, `FOLLOW_ENTITY_KINDS`, Zod enums — **must stay aligned** with Postgres `CHECK` constraints and polymorphic columns (see file header + migrations).
- **`taxonomy.ts`** — `DomainLayer`, category keys (26-key taxonomy), used in filters and cards.

## Auth (`lib/auth/`)

- **`require-user.ts`** — Server-side session gate; throws/redirects when unauthenticated.
- **`roles.ts`** — `isAdmin()` reads `profiles.is_admin` (per-request cache); `assertAdmin()` for admin-only server actions (pairs with RLS on curriculum tables).

## Server action helpers (`lib/actions/`)

- **`profile-schema.ts`** / **`profile.ts`** — Zod schemas and update helpers for profile settings (shared with `app/(app)/settings`).

## Retrieval / RAG (`lib/retrieval/`)

Embeddings (`embedder.ts`), **`search.ts`** hybrid retrieval, **`filters.ts`** for search params — used by Ask / assistant flows. Exports chunk types from **`types.ts`**.

## Other

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `recommender/tag-synonyms.ts` | Tag normalization for recommender surfaces. |
| `analytics/index.ts` | **`track` / `identify` / `reset`** — PostHog shim; no-ops until `NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY` is set (see file comment + U9.1 plans). |
| `env.ts` | Zod-validated **public + server** env; optional PostHog, Sentry, GitHub OAuth, service role. |
| `utils.ts` | `cn()` (clsx + tailwind-merge), small helpers. |

## Tests

Colocated **`*.test.ts`**; run **`pnpm test`** / **`pnpm test:watch`**. Vitest config stubs server-only imports where needed.
